    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "6A5BB9E1902FAFCC",
      "text": "Al ser un combate oficial de la Liga Arándano,\\nprimero tienes que avisar aquí.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_01",
      "hash64": "B94DB1F7E154384B",
      "text": "Te llamabas [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿verdad?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_02",
      "hash64": "B94DB2F7E15439FE",
      "text": "Muy bien. Dame un segundito mientras lo tramito\\ntodo para el combate contra el Campeón.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "6A5BBAE1902FB17F",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oye, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]... Me dijiste que Cass y tú\\nerais\\r\\ncolegas, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_select_01",
      "hash64": "3D7AE2DF3C6AE218",
      "text": "¡Sí!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_select_02",
      "hash64": "3D7AE5DF3C6AE731",
      "text": "Algo así...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "6A5BB7E1902FAC66",
      "text": "Ya veo, ya veo...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "6A5BB8E1902FAE19",
      "text": "¿Qué pasa? ¿Es que te da vergüenza admitirlo?\\nAy, estos niños y sus dramas.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "6A5BB5E1902FA900",
      "text": "Yo, si te digo la verdad, no lo trago.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "6A5BB6E1902FAAB3",
      "text": "Puede que antes fuese un chaval inseguro al que\\nse le trababa la lengua cada dos por tres y que\\r\\na la mínima se escondía detrás de su hermana...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "6A5BC3E1902FC0CA",
      "text": "¡Pero, al menos, cuando combatía, podías ver\\nque lo disfrutaba más que nadie![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "6A5BC4E1902FC27D",
      "text": "Un día cambió de buenas a primeras y ahora...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "6A5F41E19032CCBB",
      "text": "Se ha convertido en un tirano implacable que\\npresiona y oprime a los demás tanto como se\\r\\nsobreexige a sí mismo.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "6A5F40E19032CB08",
      "text": "Necesita que alguien le abra los ojos.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "6A5F43E19032D021",
      "text": "Mira que yo lo he intentado, pero, como me\\nlo tomo todo con tanta pachorra, no ha habido\\r\\nforma... Siento tener que endiñarte el marrón.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_03",
      "hash64": "B94DB3F7E1543BB1",
      "text": "Perdonad por la espera. Ya está todo listo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_04",
      "hash64": "B94DB4F7E1543D64",
      "text": "¿Te gustaría enfrentarte a Cass, el Campeón de\\nla Liga Arándano?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_05",
      "hash64": "B94DB5F7E1543F17",
      "text": "Muy bien, tan solo tienes que avisarme cuando\\nestés preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_06",
      "hash64": "B94DB6F7E15440CA",
      "text": "¡De acuerdo!\\c\\nEl combate empezará en breves instantes.\\nPrepárate a conciencia.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "6A5F42E19032CE6E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ya sabes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Cuento contigo,\\n¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "6A5F45E19032D387",
      "text": "Yo y los demás del Alto Mando te estaremos\\nanimando desde el público.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_system_01",
      "hash64": "D77E99BA121E009B",
      "text": "♪¡Din, don, dan, din!♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_01",
      "hash64": "671B74F0D8D8F0E1",
      "text": "¡Aviso de la Liga Arándano!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_02",
      "hash64": "671B71F0D8D8EBC8",
      "text": "El Campeón se batirá en breve en la arena de\\ncombate de la entrada.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_03",
      "hash64": "671B72F0D8D8ED7B",
      "text": "Todos aquellos que deseen asistir como público\\ndeben dirigirse sin demora a la entrada.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_system_02",
      "hash64": "D77E9ABA121E024E",
      "text": "♪¡Din, don, dan, don!♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "6A5F44E19032D1D4",
      "text": "¡El futuro de Cass y el del Club de la Liga están\\nen tus manos, colega![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
